* gain node XOA.nog/XOB.nog to oa/ob.  Those four devices are on the die and
* they make the cell SELF-OSCILLATE: zero-stimulus, v=1, tt, io pk-pk
* 1.326 units where sim12 gives 0.032 units of trapezoidal ringing on
* bit-static node voltages.
*
* Electrically identical to emlcell_b_sim13_lvsfaithful.inc (verified device
